==== LRC n=14 carry-fiber conservativity diagnostic (S611) ====
C=2n-1=27; floor=1/14

THM-407 shell orbits under G=<2,-1> modulo 27:
  gcd= 1: (1, 2, 4, 5, 7, 8, 10, 11, 13)
  gcd= 3: (3, 6, 12)
  gcd= 9: (9,)

Carry/CRT identity:
  For every scalar probe x=u*v, write x=r+27k with 1<=r<=26.
  Since 27 == -1 (mod 14), x mod 14 is r-k mod 14.
  Therefore the carry vector k is visible to the n=14 clock ledger.

